>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Restaurant, catering and food business careers cover kitchen, service, operations, purchasing and ownership, and they reward consistency, hygiene, cost control and calm teamwork during busy hours.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

  <div class="key-takeaways">
    <p class="key-takeaways__label">The short version</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Short answer:</strong> Hygiene and consistency matter more than a big menu.</li>
      <li><strong>Evidence:</strong> This page quotes no statistics or pay figures and was not built from fetched sources. Ten live notices and two conversations, as set out below, are the best way to get current local evidence.</li>
      <li><strong>Growth:</strong> Clear proof and finished work support an earlier path to financial freedom.</li>
